        <mj-button href="https://repeatonline.com.br/discount/VOLTA15?redirect=%2Fcollections%2Fall" background-color="#d4471a" color="#ffffff" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" border-radius="40px" inner-padding="18px 24px" width="100%" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="14px" padding-left="0px">GARANTIR MEUS 15% OFF</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="19px" color="#8a4b3f" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">O botão já aplica o cupom no carrinho. Se preferir, digite <strong>VOLTA15</strong> no checkout.</mj-text>
